[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2026-fme-tvet-application-portal-login-step-by-step-guide-188":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},188,"2026-fme-tvet-application-portal-login-step-by-step-guide-188","2026 Fme Tvet Application Portal Login: Step-by-step Guide","\u003Cp>In this article, you will be taken through a step-by-step guide on how to successfully begin and complete your registration for the 2026 FME TVET registration.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffederal-government-tvet-program\u002F\">FME TVET Program\u003C\u002Fa> 2026 seeks to equip young Nigerians with high-quality technical skills for potential entrepreneurship or employment opportunities.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Participants of the program who complete their application on the FME TVET Application Portal are trained for free, \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffederal-goverment-offers-45000-tvet-program-2025\u002F\">given ₦22,500 monthly living stipends\u003C\u002Fa>, startup grants, certification, and a high-quality technical and vocational education. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Why Should You Apply on the FME TVET Application Portal?\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The FME TVET Initiative offers life-changing opportunities for all Nigerians – school leavers, graduates, job seekers, and artisans – positioning them for a self-sustained future. The benefits includes;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Quality Education\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Cbr \u002F>Access to high-quality technical education and vocational training programs.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Certification\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Cbr \u002F>Nationally and internationally recognized certifications upon completion.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Expert Instructors\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Cbr \u002F>Learn from industry professionals with years of practical experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Job Placement\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Cbr \u002F>Career guidance and job placement assistance for program graduates.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Global Standards\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Cbr \u002F>Training programs are aligned with global industry standards and practices.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Modern Facilities\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Cbr \u002F>State-of-the-art training facilities and equipment for hands-on learning.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>FME TVET Registration Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>What do you need for the FME TVET Registration procedure? Here are the key documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>TVET application guide\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>National Identity Number (NIN)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bank Verification Number (BVN)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) – proof of skills acquired informally or through apprenticeship\u003Cbr \u002F>OR\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>First School Leaving Certificate (FSLC)\u003Cbr \u002F>OR\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Any form of non-formal education certificate (e.g., training from NGOs, religious institutions, nomadic education or community program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply on FME TVET Application Portal Login Page\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Now that you have understood why you should apply and benefit from this federal government initiative, it is time to begin your application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>FME TVET Portal Login Procedures\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Step 1\u003C\u002Fstrong>: The first step is to visit the \u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002Ftvet.education.gov.ng\">tvet education gov ng website\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>On the website, more details about the FME TVET Initiative are provided, including answers to your likely questions.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Step 2: \u003C\u002Fstrong>Once you have read the details and are ready to proceed, click \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tvet.education.gov.ng\u002Fsignup\u002F\">\u003Cstrong>APPLY\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>. You will be directed to the signup page as shown below. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>step 3: \u003C\u002Fstrong>This page is the NIN verification page. You will be required to input your NIN number and your date of birth (DOB).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Once you click proceed, you will then be asked to input your phone number and a valid email address. An SMS will be sent to your phone number with which your NIN was registered.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Next, you will be directed to a login page (www.tvet.education.gov.ng\u002Flogin), meaning that your account with the TVET has been created.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Step 4: \u003C\u002Fstrong>Choose your preferred Program – (STC or VEI).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>There are two types of programs you can apply for on the TVET Application Portal;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Short-Term Certificate (STC) Programme (6 Months)\u003C\u002Fstrong>: Ideal for first-time trainees, school leavers, or individuals with no formal \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffme-tvet-application-portal-login\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>educational\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> background. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Vocational Education &amp; Innovation (VEI) Programme (1 year): \u003C\u002Fstrong>Ideal For: Individuals with some education or informal training experience, looking to deepen and formalize their skills.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Apply here: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tvet.education.gov.ng\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.tvet.education.gov.ng\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-28 17:27:18",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-fme-tvet-application-portal-login-step-by-step-guide\u002F69f0dfe65ac388.89011762_screenshot 2026-04-28 164449.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-fme-tvet-application-portal-login-step-by-step-guide\u002F69f0dfe65ac388.89011762_screenshot%202026-04-28%20164449.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":40,"slug":41,"title":42,"images":43,"datePosted":47,"authorName":48},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[44],{"fileName":4